            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BigShotsMom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I went about this differently. I used fresh sweet potatoes, which I microwaved until almost done and mashed them with the butter, spices and orange marmalade, omitting the sugar and vanilla extract. I then placed the sweet potatoes in a baking dish and topped with pecans and baked it along with the chops. A side of fresh steamed broccoli and I had a perfect fall dinner. Thanks!",
